  "query_preview": "Forecast:\n\nThere is decent agreement amongst the models on a strong upper-level \ntrough moving through this weekend which will bring cooler and\nbreezy conditions to the region. Looking towards next week, there\nis an interesting potential with cluster guidance hinting towards\npotentially multiple troughs moving through the area. It is far \ntoo early to pin down the finer details of what is to occur but \nthere is hope of fall-like conditions on the more distance \nhorizon.\n-thor",
